{"seq":7,"slug":"digital-minimalism","title":"数字极简主义","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 数字极简主义 简介\n\n数字极简主义是一种关于技术使用的哲学，核心主张是将有限的注意力和认知资源集中在少数经过审慎选择的工具与活动上，并坦然放弃其余一切。对于程序员和技术工作者而言，这意味着从\"工具越多越好\"的惯性思维中解脱，转向\"恰到好处\"的精准配置。\n\n在 2026 年的技术生态中，开发者平均在一个迭代周期内切换 7.4 种不同工具，83% 的软件工程师报告了因工作负荷过重导致的倦怠感。AI 工具的爆发式增长使组织平均使用的 AI 辅助工具从 2023 年的 2 种激增至 7 种以上。工具过载已不再是个人偏好问题，而是一个系统性的生产力陷阱。\n\n本知识库从工程师视角出发，系统探讨如何用减法思维重塑技术栈，建立可持续的工具使用体系。\n\n第一章**工具过载问题**深入剖析信息过载、决策疲劳和工具焦虑的形成机制，揭示每增加一个工具所带来的隐性成本——认知切换税、配置维护债务和注意力碎片化。\n\n第二章**减法思维**介绍约束即自由的设计哲学、80/20 工具法则，以及 Cal Newport 提出的 Intentional Technology 框架，帮助读者建立\"少即是多\"的工具使用观。\n\n第三章**选型决策框架**提供可操作的工具评估矩阵、试用期协议模板和退出策略设计方法，将工具选型从主观直觉转变为结构化的理性决策。\n\n第四章**可持续工具实践**聚焦长期维护，包括季度工具审计方法、从焦虑到自信的心态转变路径，以及极简主义工程师的日常工作流设计。\n\n推荐学习路径：先通读第一章理解问题本质，再学习第二章建立思维模型，然后用第三章的框架做一次完整的工具栈审计，最后将第四章的实践融入日常节奏。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-overload-problem","title":"工具过载问题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/tool-overload-problem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"information-overload-decision-fatigue","title":"信息过载与决策疲劳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/tool-overload-problem/information-overload-decision-fatigue"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tool-anxiety-loop","title":"工具焦虑循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/tool-overload-problem/tool-anxiety-loop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hidden-cost-analysis","title":"隐性成本分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/tool-overload-problem/hidden-cost-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"subtraction-thinking","title":"减法思维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/subtraction-thinking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constraints-as-freedom","title":"约束即自由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/subtraction-thinking/constraints-as-freedom"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tool-rule","title":"80/20 工具法则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/subtraction-thinking/tool-rule"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intentional-technology","title":"有意识的技术使用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/subtraction-thinking/intentional-technology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"selection-framework","title":"选型决策框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/selection-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-evaluation-matrix","title":"工具评估矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/selection-framework/tool-evaluation-matrix"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trial-period-protocol","title":"试用期协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/selection-framework/trial-period-protocol"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exit-strategy-design","title":"退出策略设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/selection-framework/exit-strategy-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sustainable-tooling","title":"可持续工具实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/sustainable-tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"periodic-toolstack-audit","title":"工具栈定期审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/sustainable-tooling/periodic-toolstack-audit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"from-anxiety-to-confidence","title":"从焦虑到自信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/sustainable-tooling/from-anxiety-to-confidence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"minimalist-engineer-daily","title":"极简主义工程师日常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/digital-minimalism/sustainable-tooling/minimalist-engineer-daily"}]}]}